{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-12_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-12","title":"恶言，报应不爽","storyCode":"M8-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"18a7a2aefa46e801715c77cc9ac519c5ab0643c93927b1f3d78830e6df741d5a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"这些尸体......已经开始腐败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"W的人。魔族佬雇佣兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，我们没对他们动手。这是私刑，明摆着的暗地处决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"从很早以前就开始了吗，内部清洗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"不清楚。可能就是这几天的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，很明显的，塔露拉筹谋很久了。可恨，为什么就连我们也没能早点认出她的真面目？她这么会演戏吗，这个魔头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，塔露拉指挥着这些萨卡兹雇佣兵对付我们，不管他们是不是心甘情愿的。那还有杀死雇佣兵的必要吗？这是不是杀一儆百？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不可能......没人能威胁一个萨卡兹，更别说一群萨卡兹了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，没错，“谁要是威胁魔族佬，魔族佬就会杀了谁”，你要问我们游击队这哥几个也是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，他们要是因为追随W所以被杀了，那W究竟站在哪一边？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你猜猜看我站哪边？答对有奖哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！举起手来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，喔，别动手。哇。好大的剑。罗德岛的新打手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......W......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你......就是你杀了Scout！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"就是她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那Scout先生的仇就让我来报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。小白猫，杀我可以，但我做的事我会认，不是我做的事我可不会认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我得提醒那边那个穿成整合运动样子的罗德岛小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我认得出你也记得你，是我放跑了你，你想一想，我完全不用把你让给老爷子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout是为你们罗德岛而死的。我是被迫取走了他的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"听好，他完全可以一个人逃掉。他为了保住你和你们其他人的命，和我演了一出戏给整合运动看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我愿意杀他？我愿意杀一个萨卡兹，一个萨卡兹里现在都没剩下几个的匿形大师，真正的神射手，下一个卡兹戴尔英雄胚子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"说谎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你冲我发脾气？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你这家伙，也敢冲我发脾气？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我才要冲你发脾气！如果你本事大点，如果你们当场干死那条龙女，怎么还会死那么多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么还要我去杀Scout，去杀我看得起的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是以为我是战争贩子？我告诉你，我是。是，没错，但和你们不一样，人的价值在我这里是有分级的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"Scout......你们给我听着！就算在巴别塔，Scout也是我觉得最有价值的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他比我贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......我再问一遍，你们究竟有什么价值让他为你们死掉？啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，咳，呸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"举起手。放下武器。我不相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我没被塔露拉烧个稀碎，没被凯尔希的怪物丢在墙上撞死已经很幸运了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那现在，能不能别再烦我些有的没的......？不是手上的家伙大说话就更有道理的，否则炸死那么多人的我岂不是正确到爆开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，凯尔希也说了，现在我和你们是站一边的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我站你们这边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要听录音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么那么急躁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你这小鬼也能读心吗还是怎么的？那你还不信我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然急。再不干掉塔露拉，我的人就要都给她弄死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹雇佣兵有个缺点，在杀人之外的时候他们是不会审时度势的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟他们说什么，他们就会去做什么，原因无他，他们根本不在乎自己，不重视生命，自己的别人的，都无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我再不去把他们重新搞回来，他们可就都要死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你能说服他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"在杀了塔露拉之后吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，浪费更多时间了，能给我让个路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"小哥，我就一句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"别让他白死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的有这个权力吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"你有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你有的。你的命是我的老同事们堆出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，够了！迷迭香，让她走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"所以她说的是真的？她保护了阿米娅她们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"就相信我，也相信她这么一回。就这么一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"那好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我可以走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"......走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"别再让我看见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"——别再让我看见你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那谢谢。放心吧，如果这回没杀掉这个龙女，我们肯定就没机会再见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他们已经行了，现在，游击队兄弟们，你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"大尉说过你不值得依赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得那个老头说得一点都没错。我说的真真假假的东西太多，要从中发掘点有意义的东西还挺难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我是没办法让你们正眼看我的，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但只有把塔露拉炸成灰这件事，我比谁都想干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，我可要说一句，你们，别老盯着别人的后背看。你根本不懂，你们不懂魔族身上发生了些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不知道我这几个死了的雇佣兵是为什么而死的。别用那种眼神看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。你们是不是就是用这种眼神看那个龙女的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的伤，你已经和塔露拉交过手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那你眼神可真好，我站在你面前才十多分钟你就发现了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我和她干了一架。而且我还输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"你伤得不轻，又打不赢，你想怎样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我还活着，已经够了。如果那个罗德岛的兔子做不到，那我就要再炸塔露拉一回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_28"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是她的对手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要去送死，我们不拦你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是可以绕道走的，朋友。我完全能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没想到你们会和罗德岛在一起，但我，我是来见你们一面的，我是特意来的。为了救你们一命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到我那些可怜兄弟的尸体了没？你们都该看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位兄弟，在这座城市里可不止剩下平民和整合运动啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的士兵穿着我们的衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经遇到过他们了。我们也已经做好了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做好了准备？你是不是想说你做好了准备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"长舌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是说实话，我很少说实话。可别是做好了送死的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉既然敢搞这一套，说明她根本不在乎整合运动。她想整合运动死在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再见，各位。只要运气好，我们就都能活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们如果不信我，就试着去相信自己的运气吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祝各位好运。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_graduate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经十分接近石棺的核心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在担心什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我担心自己会保护不好你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不，Dr.{@nickname}，总有一天我会保护不了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，太多超出我们预想的力量在这大地上相互博弈，他们天灾般的暴力行径，既会带来无法预知的问题，也会带来出乎预料的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使知道一切，也未必能改变一切，这是众多悲剧的根源，也是许多旅程的开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否的确是一个值得我去保护的人？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"还猜谜？！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是利用信息不对等对你施加压力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，逼急了就算是卡特斯也会咬人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但把答案直接告诉你，只是让你更加怀疑事实。你应当自己争取真相，或者等待它直接向你打开。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会回答我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚......因为你以前就是这样一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你不是那个人。Dr.{@nickname}，答应我，你和过去的不是同一个人。"}]},{"label":"我难道不值得你这么做吗，凯尔希医生？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我有对你下过咒吗，Dr.{@nickname}？这个咒语解开了，然后反扑在我身上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"值得与否不是我来判断的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是不值得，我也会这么做，理由的话，一会儿我也许有机会说给你听。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——牧群！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"你们到哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹牧群","speakerId":"avg_npc_091","isRemote":false,"text":"回家吗？回回回回家吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可以断定，整个核心区的萨卡兹雇佣兵都已经遭到了转化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"各位干员，打开自净开关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在拯救他人的生命之前，先保护好自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......你真的要承载起这样不幸的种族的命运吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
